{"title":"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the average of the integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a4c3ee181d10a67e0b221967be261d0151d463a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71, 72, 73, 74, 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/281590966bd403fae179ae3a50e6532f23929d88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71 + 72 + 73 + 74 + 75 = 146 \\times 2 + 73 = 292 + 73 = 365$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"448\" height=\"15\" />. Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers, the average is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c29a67bf937265d2f270e84a6335d3cbc22944ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{365}{5} = \\boxed{73}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the numbers have the same common difference between each other, the average is equal to the median of the numbers. There are an odd number of numbers, so this would just be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/0/9a0c1085eb3ba5eb6376bc00e7ea24690c680775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{73}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017223246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 77/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 967/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.797      1 2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.797      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37011:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017223246 and revision id 285974. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}